{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0593_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4068d115080e865cc3f5157a16f50102defa5082640ad2572301b071cce502b3", "ja": "（今日の撮影は機材トラブルの影響で、現場の空気が\n重いときもあったが、無事明るい雰囲気で終わった）", "zh": "（今天的拍摄虽然有时受到设备故障影响，现场气氛比较沉重，但最后还是在明快的氛围中顺利结束了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0593_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "53acfd23488a99f91ebd27802bf363c1ddb5de6b7ab8e08be60cec3397d649da", "ja": "はいほー！　{$P$}さん、\n今日は一日おつかれさまなのです～！", "zh": "嗨——！　{$P$}先生，今天一整天辛苦啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0593_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f7390073f56650fc6d0a8d63528faeaf8dd2199b01213f6abcefe3b2735545e6", "ja": "お疲れ様、まつり。\n……それと、今日はありがとうな。", "zh": "辛苦了，茉莉。\n……还有，今天谢谢你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0593_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "95c0cdcbb9c7454f8566b4fd1fd7b57dfcd27943ec74f32774d48afe6dea1e87", "ja": "ほ？　何のことです？　{$P$}さんが\n謝るようなことなんて、なかったのですよ？", "zh": "嗯？是指什么呢？{$P$}先生才没有什么需要道歉的事呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0593_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d9ac7e2460296d180d27b960b773a899a0bf77ad81814025a15ea48107554966", "ja": "うん、そうだな。……ただ、まつりのおかげで\n現場の空気が明るくなったと思ったから。", "zh": "嗯，确实如此。……只是，我觉得多亏了小祭，现场的气氛变得明快起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0593_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "bf4a57417b3db635c61e4b23759ff6c7b24a42589aa805383b4ce3f9eb45fe12", "ja": "そうなのです？　姫はただ、\nいつもどおりにしていただけなのですよ。", "zh": "是这样吗？公主只是和平时一样而已哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0593_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "bf147005481f6547f7aa92184e758c084e9a4a9cc7f545f79dfaabaf90758008", "ja": "もし{$P$}さんの言うようなことが\nあったのなら、それは……。", "zh": "要是真像{$P$}先生说的那样，\n那肯定是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0593_1007_p", "source_sha256": "21fa2c84b6be80a277f012fa9c4631f4cb1ff7f5baddb1cad2c98866777de6a1", "ja": "それは……？", "zh": "就是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0593_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "94c7fe5b423fd3cc686fa4f72105f5eb9c1b669ad643260665fedd046b5246ee", "ja": "妖精さんの魔法かもしれないのです！　姫はふつうに\n共演者のみなさんとお喋りをしていただけ。", "zh": "也许是小精灵的魔法哦！公主只是和平常一样，\n和各位共演者聊天而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0593_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "34e86e148b8df18d82524fb15424ef9937793e31d9170d6ec12110bb803f2d23", "ja": "イタズラ好きな妖精さんが、姫の知らない間に\nハッピーになる魔法を使った……それだけなのです♪", "zh": "喜欢恶作剧的小精灵趁公主不知情时施展了让人开心的魔法……仅此而已哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0593_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ed431b3ca6e3523f436d481687ca7189f96ab511cb0f1d972a11d916b3378448", "ja": "なるほどな。\n……うん。やっぱり、まつりは流石だな。", "zh": "原来如此。\n……嗯，果然，まつり就是厉害啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0593_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "abf4f17d2b2b7d7228a40b85643b24ae034caa6683f4a44790d5b87a9218f66a", "ja": "むむっ、{$P$}さん。\n姫にもわかるように話して欲しいのです。", "zh": "唔唔，{$P$}先生。\n请讲得让公主也能听懂哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0593_1012_p", "source_sha256": "53b62733477ced3dd61de5a2e2b2e03cd2061a8702e367c58126486b6942dc55", "ja": "ああ、ごめん。この前、参加した番組で\nまつりが城主に選ばれただろう？", "zh": "啊，抱歉。之前参加的节目里，\n小祭被选为城主了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0593_1013_p", "source_sha256": "08a1ee18d065fcd78b1a2f97ac142a1e365e826eb343065bf251a04c5bda0a9e", "ja": "まつりの言葉で、みんなが奮起する。\nそういうカリスマ性が、勝利に繋がったのかなって。", "zh": "大家因为茉莉的话而振奋起来。\n我觉得或许就是这种领袖魅力，才带来了胜利吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0593_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "3314ebd0ccd109dcaa933311604fb339e3af2fb42b1cb0402eca91d697c3b9b1", "ja": "ふふ、その通りなのです！\n妖精さんの魔法の力もあるのですが……。", "zh": "呵呵，正是如此哦！\n当然也有妖精们魔法的力量……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0593_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "95572bfd67b706768994c8d95e26cdb556e3146abd37e8ce51fd62b14627c2de", "ja": "「姫のために頑張る」と、みんなが思ってくれた。\nその気持ちが、姫はとっても嬉しいのです。", "zh": "大家愿意想着“为了公主而加油”。\n这份心意，让公主觉得非常非常开心哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0593_1016_p", "source_sha256": "562b660d8101720c8c041f19d873e756897694a4706e59badaebe3edcfe67908", "ja": "そうだな。誰かのために頑張れる人は素敵だと思う。\n俺も、まつりのために頑張らないとな！", "zh": "是啊。我觉得能为了别人努力的人很了不起。  \n我也得为了小祭努力才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0593_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "e2ae0908832051febde43081606eac93dbecb7614e1b166a72b9c845062a2e0b", "ja": "わんだほー！　素晴らしい心掛けなのです！\n……これからも、一緒に頑張ろうね。", "zh": "太棒了！这种想法真是太棒了！\n……今后我们也要一起加油哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
